  "description": "Anthropic is giving away $1,200 of Claude, and most devs have no idea.\nThe program is called Claude for Open Source. Six months of the Max 20x plan, the $200-a-month one, completely free.\nWho qualifies: open source maintainers, core contributors, people landing pull requests across the ecosystem, or anyone keeping a critical package alive.\nSo if you've been building in public on GitHub, your side project might literally pay you back in compute.\nAnd if you haven't started a repo yet, this is the best reason you'll get all year.\n\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1WLRzX1psmKOeImlqoveWiEeHIiuR_a4G-1zIXKKxqNw/edit?usp=sharing",
